<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES RISE AT FIX.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES RISE AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>All Helibor rates rose at the</p>
<p>Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Friday. The three-mth rate</p>
<p>was rose to 3.11 pct.</p>
<p>				    August 8 fix	   August 7 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		     3.01 pct		3.02 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		     3.06 pct		3.05 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		     3.11 pct		3.10 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		     3.31 pct		3.24 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		     3.45 pct		3.42 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		    3.66 pct		3.60 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 292, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
